    Audio format conversion. Invoked as an external process, not linked.

  Silero VAD             MIT         https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad
    Voice activity detection model, loaded by whisper.cpp at runtime.

Whisper models (ggml format) are distributed by the whisper.cpp project and
are not redistributed here; scripts/setup.sh fetches them at install time.
